{"parameters": {}, "expected_outcome": "inventory_delta", "situation_assessment": "Current runtime inventory shows oak_log:2, oak_planks:2, crafting_table:1, white_bed:1. The wooden pickaxe goal still lacks enough planks and all sticks: a wooden pickaxe requires 3 planks and 2 sticks plus a reachable placed crafting table. The crafting_table item is already carried, so the immediate missing prerequisites are stick crafting and enough plank crafting. Because there are 2 oak_log in inventory, the prerequisite chain can be advanced without gathering more logs: logs can be converted to planks, then planks to sticks. Nearby world evidence shows no placed crafting_table block yet, but that is the next prerequisite after sticks/planks are available; this turn should create the recipe materials first.", "why_this_tool": "action-card-022 is the actor-owned Craft Planks And Sticks behavior and directly matches the current missing prerequisites. It is broader than a single craft_item call because it can convert logs to planks and planks to sticks as one bounded prerequisite chain, using the existing oak_log and oak_planks. This avoids unnecessary log collection and moves the episode toward wooden_pickaxe crafting. The direct craft_item card could craft only one inventory-grid recipe at a time, which would be slower and less aligned with the focus statement to confirm or craft required sticks and planks.", "success_evidence": 
["Runtime inventory evidence shows sticks present, ideally stick count >= 2.", "Runtime inventory evidence shows oak_planks present, ideally oak_planks count >= 3.", "Runtime inventory evidence shows oak_log decreased or otherwise transformed, confirming crafting consumed or used available logs/planks.", "No wooden_pickaxe is required yet; this turn succeeds if plank/stick prerequisites are created."]

, "failure_handling": "If runtime evidence shows no sticks or insufficient planks afterward, pivot to direct primitive craft_item actions in order: craft oak_planks from oak_log, then craft stick from oak_planks. If inventory becomes unexpectedly empty of logs or planks, observe once to refresh inventory and nearby blocks. If the skill fails because no crafting recipe is available, record the blocker and use action-card-005 with explicit itemName values. Once sticks and at least 3 planks exist, proceed to place or use the crafting_table and then craft wooden_pickaxe."}

